  "title": "unified Deep Dive",
  "description": "The remark/rehype pipeline that turns \"normal markdown\" into Dendron-flavored markdown with wikilinks, note references, block anchors, tags, and all the publishing transforms. This package is the single source of truth for how Dendron parses and transforms note content. Touch it and you touch preview, publishing, graph, backlinks, and pods.",
